## SGSD Overlay

This repo uses Super GSD for autonomous orchestration. The framework lives at
`super-gsd/` (directory junction to the canonical install at
`C:\Users\user\GSDedits\super-gsd`). The full orchestrator contract is
in `super-gsd/CLAUDE-OVERLAY.md` — read that first.

Quick reference:
- `.planning/STATE.md` — current milestone/phase state
- `.planning/milestones/` — phase plans + artifacts
- `.planning/metrics/` — telemetry (codex-log, activity-log, narrative, etc.)
- `/sgsd-orchestrate go` — start the autonomous loop
- `/sgsd-discuss-phase <N>` — gather context before planning
- `/gsd-plan-phase <N>` — produce a PLAN.md from CONTEXT.md
- `/sgsd-onboard --check` — readiness check across 15 SGSD components

To refresh this overlay against the canonical version, run
`/sgsd-overlay-refresh` (re-replaces content between these markers).

